{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02928","headline":"修书院学士奉勅宴梁王宅 · 魏元忠","name":"修书院学士奉勅宴梁王宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大君敦宴赏，万乘下梁园。\n酒助闲平乐，人沾雨露恩。\n荣光开帐殿，佳气满旌门。\n愿陪南岳寿，长奉北宸樽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏元忠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02928.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02928","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}